WEBVTT

34:38.394 --> 34:40.813
- Where have you been?
- Watch duty.

34:40.938 --> 34:43.232
- With Sam.
- Ah, Prince Porkchop.

34:43.358 --> 34:45.193
- Where is he?
- He wasn't hungry.

34:45.318 --> 34:47.070
- Impossible!
- (CHUCKLES)

34:47.195 --> 34:49.238
That's enough.

34:55.495 --> 34:58.373
Sam's no different from the rest of us.

34:58.498 --> 35:01.959
There was no place for him in the world,
so he's come here.
